  <item>
    <title>37 杂食读者的年度阅读盘点</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6943f6dce5ac0b31c9b8531a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6943f6dce5ac0b31c9b8531a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 18 Dec 2025 12:54:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>好久不见，虽然今年没做几集播客，但是读了很多书，每天都有故事相伴，完全是一个患有“故事饥渴症”的杂食读者。明年我一定会勤奋地更新播客！！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>时间轴：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a> 终于读了！一直久闻大名，终于读了并且喜欢的书</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="508">08:28</a> 最喜欢的科幻设定</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="678">11:18</a> 年读最佳电子榨菜</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1122">18:42</a> 我为什么在看这个......土味狗血但上头的北美晋江</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1477">24:37</a> 最想拥抱的文学角色</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1766">29:26</a> 明年的文学vibe</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrM6F4Naw-M-9WH-26dgs_kNRTfw.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>今年读了45本书！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>相关往期节目：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>今年的看的很多历史小说 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683d5c0f31215eb506e41a6e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/683d5c0f31215eb506e41a6e"><span>ep36 在先秦时代追寻姓氏起源</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>厄休拉·勒古恩 书迷请集合 </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671274bbdb2cf827573e70f8" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671274bbdb2cf827573e70f8"><span>ep32 《西岸传奇》三部曲</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62cfe5bcfa15142e172517cd" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62cfe5bcfa15142e172517cd"><span>ep04 《世界的词语是森林》上</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62d93252fa15142e17251e02" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62d93252fa15142e17251e02"><span>ep05 《世界的词语是森林》下</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63eb9fa1e99bdef7d3b70c06" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/63eb9fa1e99bdef7d3b70c06"><span>ep12 再谈勒古恩</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>本期提到的作品：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《正常人》、《美丽的世界，你在哪里》萨利·鲁尼</span></p><span></span><p><span>《天钧》厄休拉·勒古恩</span></p><span></span><p><span>《西游记》《射雕英雄传》</span></p><span></span><p><span>One Dark Window, Two Twisted Crowns, by Rachel Gillig</span></p><span></span><p><span>The Knight and the Moth, by Rachel Gillig</span></p><span></span><p><span>Alchemised, by Sen Lin Yu</span></p><span></span><p><span>《雷峰塔》张爱玲</span></p>]]></description>
